\pard\b\f0\fs24 Ava Meerakavita (Lady Meera)\b0\f1\fs18\par
\b\f0\par
Ethnicity:\b0\f1  Indian.\par
\b\f0 Position:\b0\f1  Senior councillor, security adviser and political advocate operating around the Protectant/Federation interface.\par
\b\f0 Age:\b0\f1  132.\par
\b\f0 Sex:\b0\f1  Female.\par
\b\f0 Height:\b0\f1  172 cm.\par
\b\f0 Build:\b0\f1  Tall and frail-looking, but commanding.\par
\b\f0 Role in Story:\b0\f1  Political counterweight to Marcellus. Ava protects John where she can, pressures the Protectant for transparency, and quietly champions machine rights.\par
\b\f0 Goal:\b0\f1  Prevent another authoritarian misuse of advanced technology and keep human political power accountable to the lives it governs.\par
\b\f0 Physical Description:\b0\f1  Weathered, elegant and regal. She moves with deliberate grace and usually appears in richly patterned dress.\par
\b\f0 Personality:\b0\f1  Perceptive, dry-witted, maternal and politically dangerous in the best sense. She softens rooms without surrendering control of them.\par
\b\f0 Occupation:\b0\f1  High-level Federation political operator and advocate.\par
\b\f0 Habits/Mannerisms:\b0\f1  Uses quiet intelligence networks ("little birds"), speaks in layered warnings, and disarms stronger personalities by letting them underestimate her.\par
\b\f0 Background:\b0\f1  Worked with John's mother in the Serva Vitae era and still carries old knowledge about the project that most of the Protectant either buried or forgot.\par
\b\f0 Internal Conflicts:\b0\f1  She sees the wider game clearly, but her reach inside Protectant secrecy is never total.\par
\b\f0 External Conflicts:\b0\f1  Locked in a long institutional struggle with Marcellus and those who prefer control to transparency.\par
\b\f0 Notes:\b0\f1  She remains in her original aged body by choice, treating visible age as proof of lived political experience rather than something to erase.\par
}
